<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pacific BBA sees improved second half.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pacific BBA sees improved second half.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific BBA Ltd said it sees increased sales and earnings in the six months ended December 31 after reporting a 27 percent lift in net profit to A$12.60 million for the 1997 first half.</p>
</text>
